[size=2][color=#A1A1AA]Built with safetyhook (cursey), Zydis, Dear ImGui (Omar Cornut), nlohmann/json (Niels Lohmann), .NET, netcoredbg (Samsung), stb and stb_vorbis (Sean Barrett), dr_libs (David Reid), bc7enc, and speexdsp (Xiph.org).[/color][/size]
